  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a string SSS of length NNN consisting of lowercase latin alphabets from aaa to ttt.\n\nA string is called good if the frequency of **all** of the characters present in the string is **odd**. For example, aabaaabaaaba is good as there are two characters aaa and bbb in the string with frequency 333 and 111 respectively, both of which are odd. The string bcbbcbbcb is not good as the frequency of character bbb is 222.\n\nFind the **minimum** integer kkk such that there exists an integer array BBB of size k+1k+1k+1 satisfying:\n\n\nB1=0B_1 = 0B1​=0;\nBk+1=NB_{k+1} = NBk+1​=N;\nBi&lt;Bi+1&nbsp;(1≤i≤k)B_i \\lt B_{i+1} \\ (1\\le i \\le k)Bi​&lt;Bi+1​&nbsp;(1≤i≤k);\nS[Bi+1,Bi+1]S[B_{i}+1, B_{i+1}]S[Bi​+1,Bi+1​] is good for **all** 1≤i≤k,1\\le i \\le k,1≤i≤k, where S[L,R]S[L, R]S[L,R] denotes the substring SLSL+1…SRS_LS_{L+1}\\ldots S_RSL​SL+1​…SR​.\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains a single integer NNN — the length of the string SSS.\nThe second line contains the string SSS, consisting of lowercase latin alphabets from aaa to ttt.\n\n\nOutput Format\nOutput the minimum integer kkk satisfying the conditions mentioned in the statement.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "String SSS consists of lowercase latin alphabets from aaa to ttt."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "5\nabcbd",
        "output": "2",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nThe minimum value of kkk satisfying given conditions is 222. Consider array B=[0,3,5]B = [0, 3, 5]B=[0,3,5] of size k+1=3k+1=3k+1=3. Here:\n\nSubstring S[1,3]=abcS[1,3] = abcS[1,3]=abc is good since all characters a,b,a, b,a,b, and ccc have frequency 111.\nSubstring S[4,5]=bdS[4,5] = bdS[4,5]=bd is good since both characters bbb and ddd have frequency 111."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "7\nabcdadd",
        "output": "2",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nThe minimum value of kkk satisfying given conditions is 222. Consider array B=[0,3,7]B = [0, 3, 7]B=[0,3,7] of size k+1=3k+1=3k+1=3. Here:\n\nSubstring S[1,3]=abcS[1,3] = abcS[1,3]=abc is good since all characters a,b,a, b,a,b, and ccc have frequency 111.\nSubstring S[4,7]=daddS[4,7] = daddS[4,7]=dadd is good since characters aaa and ddd have frequency 111 and 333, both of which are odd."
      }
    ]
  },
